SPI_01_SEND.c

Implemented SPI communication in master mode to transmit data to a slave device. Configured SPI clock settings, data frame format, and chip select control for reliable data transfer.

SPI_01_SLAVE.c

Developed SPI slave functionality to receive and process data from an SPI master device. Handled incoming data synchronization using SPI status flags and interrupts.

SPI_02_WRITE_ST7789.c

Interfaced the ST7789 TFT display using SPI communication. Sent display commands and pixel data to initialize and control the graphical display module.

SPI_03_TO_TFT_LCD.c

Developed an SPI-based TFT LCD driver for displaying text, graphics, and images. Implemented high-speed data transfer to achieve efficient screen updates and display control.
